dated_at":"2026-03-11T12:28:29Z","closed_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113479","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113479.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113479.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:27Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10276 .\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a disclosure button on the left side of each track group in the Animation tab's track editor. Clicking it hides all of the child tracks:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/092d00c6-a5c9-486b-be5a-3772da5966e8\r\n\r\nCollapsed group data is saved in Animation resources, so it persists across editing sessions. However, toggling the visibility of a group does *not* currently count as an action that dirties the scene/resource (i.e., it doesn't make it display as \"unsaved\" the way that moving a keyframe does).\r\n\r\n## TODOs\r\n- [x] Find a better way of saving collapse states, likely as part of the `EditorFolding` class in `editor/settings/editor_folding.cpp`.\r\n- [x] Investigate an error that sometimes occurs when performing a box selection (doesn't seem to break anything but the error message is annoying).\r\n- [x] Auto-update the names of folded groups when the nodes they represent are renamed.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","star